{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00816","headline":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 显仁舞 · 张昭","name":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 显仁舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"运极金行谢，天资水德隆。\n礼神鄜畤馆，布政未央宫。\n诘旦备明祀，登歌荅茂功。\n云轩临降久，星俎荐陈丰。\n霭霭沈檀雾，铿锵环佩风。\n荧煌升藻藉，肸蠁转珠栊。\n尊祖咸韶备，贻孙书轨同。\n京坻长有积，宗社享无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}